## Available Skills & Triggers
When encountering specific engineering workflows, invoke the matching skill from `skills/`:
- `skills/project-discovery/`: Project initialization, charter drafting, environment inspection (`discovery`, `init`, `gate G0`).
- `skills/architecture-and-contracts/`: System modeling, ADR drafting, interface contract design (`architecture`, `ADR`, `contract`).
- `skills/phase-planning/`: Work breakdown structure, task scheduling, file ownership assignment (`plan`, `WBS`, `tasks`).
- `skills/controlled-implementation/`: Production code authoring within bounded file paths (`implement`, `code`).
- `skills/testing-and-verification/`: Automated test execution, evidence capture, linter auditing (`test`, `verify`, `lint`).
- `skills/independent-review/`: Adversarial review of diffs, anti-slop verification (`review`, `audit`, `gate G5`).
- `skills/documentation-and-handoff/`: 3-tier memory reconciliation, release notes, handoff contracts (`release`, `handoff`, `memory`).

---

## Subagent Delegation Protocol
When executing subagent workflows:
1. Maintain separate, isolated context per subagent.
2. Assign disjoint, non-overlapping file ownership boundaries.
3. Subagents write execution results directly to contract JSON files and structured logs.
